{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2022-11-17 11:12:00', 'title': "ANCORA ISSUES STATEMENT OF SUPPORT REGARDING HASBRO'S DECISION TO PURSUE A SALE OF EONE TV AND FILM", 'text': "CLEVELAND--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ANCORA HOLDINGS GROUP, LLC (TOGETHER WITH ITS AFFILIATES, “ANCORA” OR WE”) TODAY ISSUED THE BELOW STATEMENT REGARDING HASBRO, INC.'S (NASDAQ: HAS) (“HASBRO” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCEMENT THAT IT HAS INITIATED A SALE PROCESS FOR ITS EONE TV AND FILM BUSINESS."}